-- Derived tag (s57b): the derived-tag registry under Japanese grammar — 北 resolves through the alias to the `as`-declared tag, one hop, then the entry; pins identical to the ASCII twin and to the s57a pair.
--! registry ../registries/132-derived-tag-b.reg
--! ja
--! expect gold = 900 600 700 650 221
--! expect master = 2 -1 -1 4 -1

北 と 金 五十 より 、 金 に 五百 たす
